sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Ingress as Platform Ingress<br/>Gateway/Istio<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant AG as autogluonserver Pod<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Factory as PredictorFactory<br/>Auto-detection
    participant Storage as Model Storage<br/>S3/GCS/Azure/HF<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 1: AutoGluon Model Inference

    Client->>Ingress: POST /v1/models/{name}:predict<br/>Auth: Bearer/mTLS (platform)
    Ingress->>AG: Forward to pod<br/>8080/TCP HTTP (pod-internal)

    alt First request (model loading)
        AG->>Factory: Load model from --model_dir
        Factory->>Storage: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: IAM/Bearer
        Storage-->>Factory: Model artifacts
        Factory->>Factory: Try TabularPredictor
        alt TabularPredictor succeeds
            Factory-->>AG: TabularModel loaded
        else TabularPredictor fails
            Factory->>Factory: Try TimeSeriesPredictor
            Factory-->>AG: TimeSeriesModel loaded
        end
    end

    AG->>AG: Run inference
    AG-->>Ingress: JSON prediction response
    Ingress-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 1b: v2 Open Inference Protocol (Tabular only)

    Client->>Ingress: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>InferRequest payload
    Ingress->>AG: Forward to pod<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    AG->>AG: Map v2 tensors to AutoGluon columns
    AG-->>Ingress: InferResponse (typed outputs)
    Ingress-->>Client: v2 InferResponse

    Note over Client,Storage: Flow 1c: Model Metadata Query

    Client->>Ingress: GET /v2/models/{name}
    Ingress->>AG: Forward to pod
    AG-->>Ingress: ModelMetadataResponse<br/>(input/output types per feature)
    Ingress-->>Client: Model metadata JSON

    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as kserve-controller-manager
    participant KnativeIstio as Knative/Istio/Gateway API

    Note over Controller,KnativeIstio: Flow 2: InferenceService Reconciliation

    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch InferenceService events<br/>TLS 1.2+, ServiceAccount
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update resources<br/>(Deployments, Services)
    Controller->>KnativeIstio: Create Knative Service /<br/>Istio VirtualService / HTTPRoute

    participant LMController as localmodel Controller
    participant LMNode as localmodelnode Agent
    participant DownloadJob as Download Job

    Note over LMController,Storage: Flow 3: Local Model Caching

    LMController->>K8sAPI: Create PV/PVC for node cache<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount
    LMNode->>K8sAPI: Create download Job<br/>HTTPS/6443, ServiceAccount
    DownloadJob->>Storage: Download model<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: IAM/Bearer
    Storage-->>DownloadJob: Model artifacts
    DownloadJob-->>LMNode: Job complete
    LMNode->>K8sAPI: Update LocalModelNode status
